s</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Control events&#x0002f;patients</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>OR (95&#x00025; CI)</bold></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr><td colspan="5" align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><italic>Assessable patients</italic></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Leukopenia<sup>a</sup></td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">4 (a, b, c, d)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">538&#x0002f;591</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">470&#x0002f;585</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">2.48 (1.75&#x02013;3.52)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Nausea or vomiting<sup>b</sup></td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">3 (a, b, c)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">32&#x0002f;472</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">59&#x0002f;471</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0.51 (0.32&#x02013;0.80)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Neurotoxicity</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">3 (a, b, c)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">20&#x0002f;466</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0&#x0002f;469</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">43.11 (2.60&#x02013;714.94)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Randomised patients</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign